on in Wyoming\">2022</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#DDDDDD\">Incumbent retiring to <a href=\"/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Wyoming\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Wyoming\">run for U.S. Senate</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Hageman&#95;68-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Hageman-68\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>64<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td nowrap=\"\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"color: #E81B23;\">▌</span><a href=\"/wiki/Chuck_Gray_(Wyoming_politician)\" title=\"Chuck Gray (Wyoming politician)\">Chuck Gray</a> (Republican)</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #A356DE;\">▌</span>Jeffrey Haggit (Constitution)</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #fed000;\">▌</span>Shawn Johnson (Libertarian)</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0044C9;\">▌</span><a href=\"/wiki/Lisa_F._Kinney\" title=\"Lisa F. Kinney\">Lisa Kinney</a> (Democratic)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Non-voting_delegates\">Non-voting delegates</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=74\" title=\"Edit section: Non-voting delegates\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Delegates_to_the_United_States_House_of_Representatives\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Delegates to the United States House of Representatives\">Delegates to the United States House of Representatives</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatn